# Generated by build.sh
manifest.json

*.log

# Demo / project artifacts under examples/<project>/. The export and the verify
# stage regenerate everything below; only the heavy and scratch files are
# ignored. The light deliverables that sit next to them are tracked on purpose
# (a fresh clone then opens the demo in chiplet-studio and carries the DRC
# results without a rebuild): the .chiplet, the _interposer.gds, the *.json
# sidecars and *_assembly_drc.lyrdb.
#
# Keep this block in lockstep with .dockerignore, and with the per-project
# .gitignore that `adk-new-project` scaffolds (same patterns, project-relative).
#
# outputs/ : ignore only the heavy GDS, the intermediate .hyp, the DRC working
#            dir and the run logs.
examples/**/outputs/*_complete.gds
examples/**/outputs/*.hyp
examples/**/outputs/assembly_drc/
examples/**/outputs/logs/
# kicad/ : KiCad's own scratch (caches, autosaves, lock files, local prefs).
examples/**/*-backups/
examples/**/fp-info-cache
examples/**/*.kicad_prl
examples/**/_autosave-*
examples/**/*.lck
